BT /F1 10 Tf 40 279 Td (  D. 0) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 40 264 Td (Answer: A) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 40 249 Td (  An antiderivative of 2x is x?. Evaluate from 0 to 1: 1? - 0? = 1. It is also the area of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 40 234 Td (  a triangle with base 1 and height 2, so 1.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 40 219 Td () Tj ET
