BT /F1 10 Tf 40 174 Td (The derivative rules that cover the 2BAC STE exam: powers, products, quotients, the chain rule, exponentials, logs and trigonometry.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 40 159 Td (Key points:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 40 144 Td (- Learn the table of standard derivatives.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 40 129 Td (- Product rule: u?v + uv?; quotient rule: \(u?v - uv?\)/v?.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 40 114 Td (- Chain rule: outside derivative times inside derivative.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 40 99 Td (- Tangent slope is f?\(a\); use the sign of f? for variations.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 40 84 Td () Tj ET
